              "id": "wgt_hero",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"ax-container ax-hero-inner\"><div class=\"ax-hero-copy\"><p class=\"ax-eyebrow\">Unified Business Communication</p><h1>All-In-One Business <span class=\"ax-grad\">Communication Solutions</span></h1><p class=\"ax-lead\">Crystal-clear VoIP calls, AI-driven insights, instant messaging, VFAX, advanced call management, and much more — all in one platform built to scale with your business.</p><div class=\"ax-cta-row\"><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"ax-btn ax-btn-primary ax-btn-lg\">Book a Demo</a><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"ax-btn ax-btn-outline ax-btn-lg\">Book a Discovery Call</a></div><ul class=\"ax-hero-points\"><li>HD VoIP &amp; Softphone</li><li>AI Call Insights</li><li>SMS &amp; Team Chat</li><li>24/7 Support</li></ul></div><div class=\"ax-hero-visual\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-hero\">[Product Screenshot]</div><div class=\"ax-float-card ax-float-1\"><div class=\"ax-float-dot ax-dot-green\"></div><div><strong>AI Sentiment</strong><span>+24% positive</span></div></div><div class=\"ax-float-card ax-float-2\"><div class=\"ax-float-dot ax-dot-blue\"></div><div><strong>Live Calls</strong><span>312 active</span></div></div></div></div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "sec_features",
      "elType": "section",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
        "css_classes": "ax-section ax-features",
        "custom_id": "products",
        "content_width": "full",
        "padding": { "unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true }
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "col_features",
          "elType": "column",
          "settings": {
            "_column_size": 100,
            "_inline_size": null,
            "padding": { "unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true }
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "wgt_features",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"ax-container\"><header class=\"ax-section-head\"><p class=\"ax-eyebrow\">Platform</p><h2>Tap Into Features That Fuel Success</h2><p class=\"ax-sub\">One platform. Nine purpose-built modules. Every channel your team needs to win the customer.</p></header><div class=\"ax-tabs\" data-ax-tabs><div class=\"ax-tab-buttons\" role=\"tablist\"><button class=\"ax-tab-btn is-active\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"softphone\">Softphone</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"sms\">SMS</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"chat\">Chat</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"recordings\">Recordings</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"reports\">Reports</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"pbx\">PBX</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"vfax\">VFax</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"files\">File Transfer</button><button class=\"ax-tab-btn\" role=\"tab\" data-tab=\"meetings\">Meetings</button></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel is-active\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"softphone\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>Softphone</h3><p>HD calling, smart search, and presence awareness in a unified desktop &amp; mobile app.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>HD voice quality</li><li>Presence indicators</li><li>Smart contact search</li><li>Click-to-dial anywhere</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#softphone\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[Softphone Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"sms\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>SMS</h3><p>Send professional business text messages and group SMS without losing the conversation thread.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Two-way business SMS</li><li>Group messaging</li><li>Templated responses</li><li>Compliance archiving</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#sms\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[SMS Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"chat\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>Chat</h3><p>One-on-one and group messaging with file sharing — keep your team in sync.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Direct &amp; group chat</li><li>File sharing</li><li>Channels &amp; threads</li><li>Read receipts</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#chat\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[Chat Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"recordings\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>Recordings</h3><p>AI sentiment analysis and transcription on every call you choose to record.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Automatic transcription</li><li>AI sentiment scoring</li><li>Searchable archive</li><li>Compliance retention</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#recordings\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[Recordings Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"reports\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>Reports</h3><p>Performance tracking and customized analytics dashboards across your whole team.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Real-time dashboards</li><li>Custom KPIs</li><li>Scheduled exports</li><li>Agent leaderboards</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#reports\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[Reports Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"pbx\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>PBX</h3><p>Call distribution, smart routing, and queueing to make sure no caller is left on hold.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Smart routing rules</li><li>Queue management</li><li>IVR menus</li><li>Hunt groups</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#pbx\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[PBX Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"vfax\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>VFax</h3><p>Cloud-based faxing with reusable templates — secure, compliant, and paperless.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>Send/receive online</li><li>HIPAA-ready</li><li>Template library</li><li>Activity logs</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#vfax\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[VFax Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"files\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>File Transfer</h3><p>Encrypted file storage and granular access controls for sharing inside &amp; outside the org.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>End-to-end encryption</li><li>Access controls</li><li>Version history</li><li>External share links</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#files\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[File Transfer Screenshot]</div></div></div><div class=\"ax-tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-panel=\"meetings\"><div class=\"ax-tab-copy\"><h3>Meetings</h3><p>Video meetings with screen sharing, recording, and built-in scheduling.</p><ul class=\"ax-check-list\"><li>HD video meetings</li><li>Screen sharing</li><li>Cloud recording</li><li>Calendar integrations</li></ul><a href=\"/products/#meetings\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">See it in action →</a></div><div class=\"ax-tab-visual\"><div class=\"ax-placeholder ax-placeholder-feature\">[Meetings Screenshot]</div></div></div></div></div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
