          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "wgt_industries",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"ax-container\"><header class=\"ax-section-head\"><p class=\"ax-eyebrow\">Solutions by Industry</p><h2>Built for the Way Your Industry Works</h2><p class=\"ax-sub\">Pain points are different in every vertical. Our platform meets each one with purpose-built workflows.</p></header><div class=\"ax-industry-grid\"><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>H</span></div><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>HIPAA-ready calls, secure messaging, and appointment workflows that keep patient data protected.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#healthcare\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>V</span></div><h3>Veterinary</h3><p>Practice-wide call routing, SMS reminders, and Covetrus integration for streamlined ops.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#veterinary\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>R</span></div><h3>Real Estate</h3><p>Mobile-first softphone, listing-line routing, and SMS that keeps deals moving while you're on the road.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#real-estate\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>E</span></div><h3>Education</h3><p>Campus-wide directories, parent-teacher SMS, and reliable conferencing for hybrid learning.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#education\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>H</span></div><h3>High Tech</h3><p>API-first platform that plugs into your existing CRM, ticketing, and analytics stack.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#high-tech\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>C</span></div><h3>Consumer Services</h3><p>Front-desk-ready PBX with smart queues so no booking call goes unanswered.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#consumer\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>L</span></div><h3>Logistics</h3><p>Dispatch SMS, driver hotlines, and reporting that ties calls to deliveries.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#logistics\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article><article class=\"ax-industry-card\"><div class=\"ax-industry-icon\"><span>F</span></div><h3>Finance</h3><p>Compliance recording, archiving, and call-quality reporting your auditors will love.</p><a href=\"/solutions/#finance\" class=\"ax-link-arrow\">Learn more →</a></article></div></div>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

