                "html": "<div class=\"ax-container ax-integrations-inner\"><div class=\"ax-integrations-copy\"><p class=\"ax-eyebrow\">Integrations</p><h2>Seamlessly Connects to the Tools You Already Use</h2><p>Salesforce, Covetrus, HubSpot, Slack, Microsoft Teams, Zendesk — and dozens more.</p><a href=\"/products/\" class=\"ax-btn ax-btn-primary\">Explore Integrations</a></div><div class=\"ax-logo-wall\"><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Salesforce</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">HubSpot</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Slack</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">MS Teams</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Covetrus</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Zendesk</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Zapier</div><div class=\"ax-logo-tile\">Google</div></div></div>"
